sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant Q as Virtual Waiting Room
    participant ILS as Inventory Locking Service
    participant R as Redis TTL Hold Store
    participant BS as Booking Service
    participant PG as Payment Gateway
    participant TIW as Ticket Issuance Worker

    U->>Q: Join Queue for Event
    Q-->>U: Wait in Queue
    Q->>U: Admission Token Granted

    U->>ILS: Request Seat Hold (with Token)
    ILS->>R: Attempt Atomic Lock on Seats with TTL
    alt Lock Failed (Seats Taken)
        R-->>ILS: Lock Denied
        ILS-->>U: Error: Seats Unavailable
    else Lock Succeeded
        R-->>ILS: Lock Acquired (TTL = 15m)
        ILS-->>U: Hold Granted

        U->>BS: Initialize Checkout / Payment Intent
        BS->>PG: Create Payment Intent
        PG-->>BS: Payment ID & URL
        BS-->>U: Redirect to Payment

        U->>PG: Provide Payment Details
        alt Payment Timed Out (TTL Expired)
            R->>R: TTL Expiry Event
            R-->>ILS: Release Hold
        else Payment Succeeded within TTL
            PG->>BS: Payment Gateway Webhook (Confirmed)
            BS->>R: Validate Hold Active
            R-->>BS: Hold Valid
            BS->>ILS: Commit Seats (Permanent)
            ILS-->>BS: Seats Committed
            BS->>TIW: Enqueue Ticket Issuance
            TIW-->>U: Send Ticket Confirmation / Barcode
        end
    end
